+# Raw Inputs
+
+Store source material here when it should feed the wiki but is not already preserved in the repository.
+
+Examples:
+
+- Product requirements copied from tickets
+- Incident timelines
+- Meeting notes
+- Command transcripts
+- Screenshots or exported logs
+
+Rules:
+
+- Prefer markdown or plain text.
+- Keep filenames descriptive and date-prefixed when useful.
+- Do not store secrets.
+- Do not edit artifacts after capture unless you are fixing a clear mistake.
+
+If the source already exists in the repo, reference it from the wiki instead of duplicating it here.
