+# Routes and Areas
+
+## Summary
+
+The route table is centralized and covers both anonymous discovery journeys and logged-in account flows. Several routes have language-prefixed variants.
+
+## Key facts
+
+- Home is served from `/` and `/:lang(es|de|fr)/`.
+- Search and property pages live under `/places/search/:id` and `/places/:id`.
+- Booking and payment flows live under `/places/:id/form`, `/places/:id/application`, `/places/:id/payment`, and payment completion routes.
+- Profile-adjacent routes include `/profile`, `/profile/leads`, `/profile/offers`, and `/activity`.
+- Content and brand pages are implemented as separate page modules under `src/pages/`.
+
+## High-level feature groups
+
+### Discovery
+
+- Home
+- Search
+- PropertyPage
+- List
+- UniversityPage
+
+### Conversion
+
+- BookForm
+- ApplicationForm
+- Payment
+- BookingDetails
+
+### Account and retention
+
+- Profile
+- Bookings
+- Offers
+- Activity
+- Settings
+- Support
+
+### Content and campaigns
+
+- Blog
+- News
+- Podcast
+- Exams
+- Ambassador
+- Scholarship
+- Referral
+- About
+
+## Evidence
+
+- Code: src/routes/index.ts
+- Code: src/pages/
+
+## Related pages
+
+- [Overview](./Overview.md)
+- [Architecture](./Architecture.md)
